1020	     *  force on its date and its figure with the late charge on top while it is open and overdue (the charge
1021	     *  while no statement binds it; a bound claim's due is the figure the statement bound, as it was shown; a
1022	     *  correction has no floor); null when the figure is n/a. */
1023	    public BigDecimal due(String sheetId, Person person, Claim claim) {
1024	        return LateCharge.dueOf(claim, figure(sheetId, person, claim), settings.floor(sheetId, claim.getDate()),
1025	                sheets.today(sheetId), grace(sheetId, person, claim),
