    35	 * included, held to the sheet's cap) and overdue-total (what is owed on their counting claims that are
    36	 * open past their due-by, late charges included, skipping n/a), and the sheet's
    37	 * claimed-total, due-total and overdue-total (the last two leaving out the single highest and lowest
