    19	/**
    20	 * The figures of a sheet's descendants (its children, the sheets naming it as their parent, then
    21	 * theirs, and so on), added up: the number of people on them and each one's due-total and
    22	 * overdue-total as that sheet shows it. The screen adds the sheet's own figures to make its
    23	 * consolidated figures. A sheet with no children has none. The sheet's own figures are answered too, as
    24	 * it shows them. Read as of a date (within the as-of view's transaction, which is rolled back), every
    25	 * sheet of the tree is put back to how it stood at the end of that day, with that date as its today.
    26	 */
    27	@Service
    28	public class ConsolidatedService {
    29	
    30	    /** The descendants, in the order found (nearest first), and their figures added up, and the sheet's own;
    31	     *  the totals with two decimals. */
    32	    public record Descendants(List<String> sheets, int peopleCount, String dueTotal, String overdueTotal,
    33	            int ownPeopleCount, String ownDueTotal, String ownOverdueTotal) {
    34	    }
    35	
    36	    private final SheetParentRepository parents;
    37	    private final Rollup rollup;
    38	    private final SheetHistory history;
    39	    private final EntityManager entityManager;
