 33	/**
 34	 * The history of each sheet, for the as-of view. Every commit of a change on a sheet keeps all the
 35	 * sheet's rows, in every table that belongs to it, against the today the change was made on: the
 36	 * sheet's today when the request making it began, so a change of the today itself (and the periods
 37	 * it closes) is kept against the day being left (see {@link HistoryTransactionManager}); a later
 38	 * change on the same today replaces what was kept for it.
 39	 * The sheet as it stood at the end of a date is what the last change made on a today on or before
 40	 * that date left, and {@link #restore} puts the sheet back to it inside a transaction that is then
 41	 * rolled back.
 42	 *
 43	 * <p>The tables that belong to a sheet are found from the schema: those with a {@code sheet_id}
 44	 * column, and those whose rows reference the rows of such a table, so a table added later is kept
 45	 * with no change here.
 46	 */
 47	@Service
 48	public class SheetHistory {
 49	
 50	    /** A body run while a request changes a sheet. */
 51	    @FunctionalInterface
 52	    public interface Body {
 53	        void run() throws IOException, ServletException;
 54	    }
